 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cause",
     "texto": [
      "**Din cauza** is followed by a noun in the genitive: **din cauza fumului** (\"because of the smoke\"), **din cauza traficului** (\"because of the traffic\")."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Result",
     "texto": [
      "**Din acest motiv** and **prin urmare** signal what happens as a result. In English, cause and consequence can be expressed in several ways."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
